                            <a href="/courses" class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-primary text-white text-xs font-semibold">এনরোল করো</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="feature-card rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-5 space-y-4">
                        <div class="aspect-video bg-gradient-to-tr from-emerald-600 to-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-white p-4 text-center">
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-xs font-bold opacity-80 uppercase tracking-widest">বোর্ড প্রশ্ন স্পেশাল</span>
